+## One trn3 node: 85k shared prefix under a latency SLO
+
+`scripts/serve_85k_trn3.sh` serves prefill and decode on one trn3 node (TP=64, FP8 KV with the 448-range profile
+`kv_profiles/Hy3-FP8_mtp_neuron_trn3.safetensors`, MTP k=3, sparse attention 0.0625, max_model_len 87040,
+up to 24 requests). `scripts/bench_85k_slo.sh` runs the closed loop: 85,000-token prompts with a 78,336-token shared
+prefix, 1024 output tokens, SLO TTFT P50 < 7 s, TPOT P50 < 20 ms, prefix-cache hit > 92%.
+C = 20 gives about 790 output tok/s with every SLO met. MATH-500 is 97.2% and needle 12/12. Flags, results, the decode
+profile and the switches that were measured and left off are in [docs/TRN3_85K_SLO.md](docs/TRN3_85K_SLO.md).
+
